======================================================================
RANK-AWARE PENALTY EXPLANATION
======================================================================

How rank-aware penalties work:
  • Top-ranked numbers (model's strongest picks) get HIGHER penalties
  • Low-ranked numbers (uncertain picks) get LOWER penalties
  • Formula: penalty = base × (0.5 + 0.5 × rank_weight)

With 25% base penalty:
  • Rank #1:  ~25.0% penalty (full strength)
  • Rank #10: ~22.5% penalty
  • Rank #25: ~18.8% penalty
  • Rank #40: ~13.8% penalty

Benefit: Encourages diversity while allowing flexibility for uncertain picks

